OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will be
OL,6,Fwidespread and heavy at times this
OL,7,Fevening. Rain largely clearing east by
OL,8,Fmidnight with just a few light and
OL,9,Fdrizzly showers following.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA rather cloudy and
OL,12,Foccasionally breezy day with a few
OL,13,Fbright spells between scattered
OL,14,Fshowers. Feeling rather chilly.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,17,Fchangeable period with showers or
OL,18,Flonger spells of rain, particularly on
OL,19,FWednesday where showers may be heavy
OL,20,Fat times. Staying quite cool for the
OL,21,Ftime of year.
